      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URBAN PRINCESS (9) is a nine-start maiden who will never get a better chance to open her account. Came from worse than midfield to get up for fourth last start over 1400m at the Sunshine Coast. Looks ready for this step up in distance and is clearly the testing material. COCCINELLA (1) stepped up to this trip last time out and found the line well without threatening at Grafton. Should take a lot from that hit-out. Looms as the obvious danger. ALKEBULAN (6) just missed in a thrilling finish over 1900m at Kilcoy two back. Struggled at 2200m last time but back to this trip gives her a decent chance. ELLOFABY (3) was tested over a mile for the first time last start and did a good job to finish just 2.6 lengths away at Gatton, making late inroads. Should be more effective over an extra 100m today.",
